OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 JUN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe Helsinki Chamber Choir, the
OL,6,     GFinnish Baroque Orchestra and
OL,7,     Gconductor Nils Schweckendiek
OL,8,     Gperform music on the theme of
OL,9,     GHope including four premieres and
OL,10,     Gmusic by Bach and Handel.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,16,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,17,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,18,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,19,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,20,     Gfavourites.
