OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,10,     GAnniversary Festival, the
OL,11,     Gacclaimed Norwegian opera singer
OL,12,     GLise Davidsen joins performs
OL,13,     GLieder by Franz Schubert, with
OL,14,     Gpianist James Baillieu.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,16,     FShostakoviches
OL,17,     GChris Addison explores the music
OL,18,     Gof Soviet regime favourite Georgy
OL,19,     GSviridov, whose melodious works
OL,20,     Goften led to his being dismissed
OL,21,     Gin the West - yet whose music
OL,22,     Gstill beguiles.
